  "protocol": "20 paired six-second cases, teams mirrored, seeds 101/202. All players update freely at 1/120 s. delayed/immediate/central prescribe one real shot; pass prescribes one real pass then reactive decisions; free is autonomous. No positions are imposed after initialization. Goalkeeper intentionally off-centre. protectionSamples counts actual cached protective intentions applied to defenders, in player-steps, via passive destination trace. Samples use ordinary update, movement, contact, goals and restarts.",
  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic scenarios, not real-match tracking",
    "Small sample; no general improvement claim",
    "Prescribed probes control initial action timing; only free is wholly autonomous",
    "Both teams use same seeded random stream but identity/order can affect mirrored outcomes",
    "First shot outcome is coarse; shots/captures do not model physical rebounds"
  ],
